# urn-collision root
library "Root".

// Two DISTINCT local libraries whose names slug to the SAME local codesystem
// id ("Local One" and "Local-One"). Both use `code is`, so both synthesize that
// shared local codesystem — the cross-library preflight in imports/emit.ts fails
// with `emit-local-codesystem-urn-collision` and returns an EMPTY manifest with a
// CLEAN graph (no import diagnostics). The FHIR public path must FOLD that
// structural error so `emit_crl_fhir`/MCP does not report a misleading success.

include "Local One".
include "Local-One".
